msgstr "Podrobnosti o Kritinem orodju za merjenje."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/measure.rst:11
msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Orodja"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/measure.rst:11
msgid "Measure"
msgstr "Merilo"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/measure.rst:11
msgid "Angle"
msgstr "Kot"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/measure.rst:11
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "Kompas"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/measure.rst:16
msgid "Measure Tool"
msgstr "Orodje Merilo"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/measure.rst:18
#, fuzzy
msgid "|toolmeasure|"
msgstr "|olmeasure|"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/measure.rst:20
msgid ""
"This tool is used to measure distances and angles. Click the |mouseleft| to "
"indicate the first endpoint or vertex of the angle, keep the button pressed, "
"drag to the second endpoint and release the button. The results will be "
"shown on the Tool Options docker. You can choose the length units from the "
"drop-down list."
msgstr ""
"To orodje se uporablja za merjenje razdalj in kotov. Kliknite |mouseleft|, "
"če želite navesti prvo končno točko ali oglišče kota, držite gumb "
"pritisnjen, povlecite kazalec na drugo končno točko in sprostite gumb. "
"Rezultati bodo prikazani v zloženem oknu orodja Možnosti. Na spustnem "
"seznamu lahko izberete enote dolžine."

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/measure.rst:23
msgid "Tool Options"
msgstr "Možnosti orodja"

#: ../../reference_manual/tools/measure.rst:25
msgid ""
"The measure tool-options allow you to change between the units used. Unit "
"conversion varies depending on the DPI setting of a document."
msgstr ""
"Možnosti orodja za merjenje omogočajo spreminjanje med uporabljenimi "
"enotami. Pretvorba med enotami se razlikuje glede na nastavitev DPI "
"dokumenta."
